LEDGER MIRROR REGISTRY (single READY backend; a recipe name of its own; the adapter is the CPU_WASM64 transfer realization)
@{registry ledger_mirror_registry version=1}
@{representation HOST_ENTRY type=Entry domain=ARRAY_BUFFER modes=copy,move lifetime=host_scope}
@{representation WASM_ENTRY type=Entry domain=WASM_LINEAR modes=copy lifetime=instance}
@{boundary Entry HOST_ENTRY}
@{conversion entry_in HOST_ENTRY -> WASM_ENTRY mode=copy preserves=value requires=CPU_WASM64}
@{backend CPU_WASM64 status=READY-CONTRACT capabilities=COMPUTE accepts=WASM_ENTRY produces=WASM_ENTRY modes=copy effects=none probes=wasm64_instantiate,wasm64_known_answer recipe=R_ENTRY_COPY lifecycle=READY,ACTIVE,CLOSED failures=TRANSIENT_OPERATION_FAILURE,PERMANENT_FOR_EPOCH}
@{authority_link CPU_WASM64 "https://doc.rust-lang.org/rustc/platform-support/wasm64-unknown-unknown.html"}
